&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;2. N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;3. N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;4. N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;5. In May, two new utilities joined the California Independent System Operator&amp;#8217;s Western Energy Imbalance Market (WEIM):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left: 1.0in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!-- [if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;-&lt;span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;Black Hills Energy (5/2026)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left: 1.0in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!-- [if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;-&lt;span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;PowerWatch (5/2026)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;Additionally, in May 2026, the Company, and PacificCorp launched the Extended Day Ahead Market EDAM, which builds on the western Energy Imbalance Market WEM that was launched in October 2014.&amp;#160; By expanding regional coordination into the day-ahead timeframe, when most electricity deliveries are planned, EDAM will leverage the West&amp;#8217;s diverse resource mix and increasingly interconnected transmission system.&amp;#160; Larger scale and regionally coordinate day ahead planning allows operator to make more optimized resource commitments and transmission usage across major supply and load centers, to better prepare the system to meet real time needs improving both efficiency and reliability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;The Western Energy Market (WEM) Governing Body provides independent regional governance for the western market, with authority over WEM and EDAM market rules that are exercised jointly with the ISO Board of Governors.&amp;#160; Joe Eto is the Chair and Mary Leslie is the Vice Chair of the ISO Board of Governors reflecting the ISO Board of Governors involvement in governance of western market initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;6. N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;7. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;8. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;9. Please refer to the Note 12 Contingencies of the 2025 Form 1 Notes to the Financial Statements for materially important legal proceedings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;10. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;11. N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;12. N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;13. N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;14. N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
